        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Garber\n- TV series: I Had Three Wives, Alias\n- Films: Titanic, Argo\n- Stage productions: Godspell, Assassins, Lend Me a Tenor\n- Roles: Jesus, Anthony Hope, John Wilkes Booth, Jack Bristow, Max, Thomas Andrews, Ken Taylor\n\nFacts:\n- Victor Garber had his first starring role on television as the lead of the series \"I Had Three Wives.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jesus in \"Godspell.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Anthony Hope.\n- Victor Garber is known for playing John Wilkes Booth in \"Assassins.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Max in \"Lend Me a Tenor.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Jack Bristow in the television series \"Alias.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for playing Thomas Andrews in James Cameron's film \"Titanic.\"\n- Victor Garber is known for portraying Ken Taylor, the Canadian Ambassador to Iran, in the film \"Argo.\"",
